# pattern_recognition — agent defaults

Read `AGENTS.md` for the full guide. Enforce at minimum:

- Absolute imports only: `from pattern_recognition...` (no flat `utils` / `models_cnn`, no relative-dot package imports).
- New preprocessing → new registered data pipeline class; keep JSON configs thin.
- Epoch-averaging experiments: JSON → `run_experiment` → artifacts under `results/`; reporting reads artifacts only.
- Do not clear historical notebook outputs unless asked.
- Do not commit raw EEG dumps (`Samara_data/`, `raw_data/`, large `.mat`/CSV) or change model math casually.
- Prefer linking/editing `docs/superpowers/specs/` over duplicating long design prose in chat.
